recommend keep-going the DRIVE family now carries a hard/soft pair on both the ceiling (hard clip / overdrive) and the floor (hard / soft center clip); the loop names its own next Lotus crux — the booked DC blocker that removes the offset the rectifier and asymmetric-drive rungs introduce, or a fresh DSP family — as its own self-approved design round
